<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Log-Tek cautions it in fresh talks.</title>
<headline>Log-Tek cautions it in fresh talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Log-Tek Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that it was involved in negotiations which if successful could impact on the group's shares.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in their sharedealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>It said the talks were unrelated to earlier negotiations with black empowerment group Phila Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
